(7637513, 1239349, 67258, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue!  The bleed into the eyes of the sandeels is something I haven''t seen before and really rather interesting.  I wonder if this puffin had a tighter grip than most?  Often some are still alive at this point - you can see tails flicking a bit - but definitely not here!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-08-08 03:24:09.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the blue!  The bleed into the eyes of the sandeels is something I haven''t seen before and really rather interesting.  I wonder if this puffin had a tighter grip than most?  Often some are still alive at this point - you can see tails flicking a bit - but definitely not here!', '2019-08-08 04:23:48.000000', '2019-08-08 04:24:09.000000', 0),
