(7637605, 1239368, 72812, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow!  Majestic inDEED!!!  I would surely expect to see this on the front page, not in 37th place with a 5.7!  Thats a travesty for this amazing image!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, SandyP!  I did think it would do a bit better but it just didn''t.  I suppose in my processing I went a bit far in trying to sharpen it up a little. Haven''t gotten any other comments on what else I need to improve upon though.  Any advice is always appreciated so feel free to let me know if you see some improving I could do. Thanks!</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Wow!  Majestic inDEED!!!  I would surely expect to see this on the front page, not in 37th place with a 5.7!  Thats a travesty for this amazing image!!!  Thanks, SandyP!  I did think it would do a bit better but it just didn''t.  I suppose in my processing I went a bit far in trying to sharpen it up a little. Haven''t gotten any other comments on what else I need to improve upon though.  Any advice is always appreciated so feel free to let me know if you see some improving I could do. Thanks!', '2019-08-08 13:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
